# ------------------------ >8 ------------------------
# Everything from the line above down is removed, so the ## headings stay.
#
# Subject: imperative, under 60 characters, no period ("Add X", "Fix Y").
#
# Each section is one to three sentences or a few bullets, written for a
# reviewer who has not seen the work. revup turns this message into the PR,
# so write it once here. Don't hard-wrap: one line per paragraph or bullet.
#   What:     the change as a user or reviewer sees it.
#   Why:      the problem it solves or what it unlocks.
#   Approach: how it works and the choices worth questioning. Skip what the
#             diff already shows. Mention how you tested it.
#
# For revup, add trailers above the line and keep one topic per PR:
#   Topic: short-name
#   Relative: parent-topic    (only when stacking on another PR)
